<Page title="What is shipped. What comes next." description="ArtemisKit’s public roadmap separates delivered capabilities from future work. The latest recorded milestone is 0.6.4: offline workflow assessment reports. Milestone numbers and individual package versions differ. Consult the core repository’s release records for exact package maps, qualification scope and publication status before selecting a version." eyebrow="Public roadmap"><h2>Delivered in the 0.6 series</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Milestone</th><th>Capability</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0.6.0</td><td>Provider-neutral agent-workflow contract and authoring.</td></tr><tr><td>0.6.1</td><td>Controlled execution, sessions, preflight and environments.</td></tr><tr><td>0.6.2</td><td>Independent outcome verification and bounded semantic criteria.</td></tr><tr><td>0.6.3</td><td>Fault handling, checkpoints and bounded recovery.</td></tr><tr><td>0.6.4</td><td>Offline technical, executive and comprehensive assessment reports.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href="https://github.com/code-sensei/artemiskit/releases/tag/v0.6.4">Read the 0.6.4 release</a>. Its CLI and SDK package version is 0.6.3; do not assume every package shares the milestone number.</p><h2>Next direction</h2><p>The recorded next milestone is comparative experiment orchestration. Broader plans include versioned assessment profiles, scenario packs and transparent scenario-specific public evidence. These are directions, not features claimed available by this website.</p><div class="ak-note">Roadmap scope can change. No hosted platform, public ranking or future feature is implied to be available. ArtemisKit and Loki are separate products.</div><div class="ak-actions"><a class="ak-btn" href="https://github.com/code-sensei/artemiskit/blob/main/ROADMAP.md">Read the source roadmap ↗</a><a class="ak-btn outline" href="https://github.com/code-sensei/artemiskit/releases">Release records ↗</a></div></Page>
